    {
      "id": "f8b7ec316575-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "If \\(\\rm x^\\frac{1}{3}-y^\\frac{1}{3} =z^\\frac{1}{3}\\) , then find the value of (x - y - z) 3 - 27xyz",
      "questionHtml": "If&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm x^\\frac{1}{3}-y^\\frac{1}{3} =z^\\frac{1}{3}\\)</span>&nbsp;, then find the value of (x - y - z)<sup>3&nbsp;</sup>- 27xyz",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "27",
          "html": "27"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "-1",
          "html": "-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm x^\\frac{1}{3}-y^\\frac{1}{3} =z^\\frac{1}{3}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Concept used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>(a - b)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup> - 3ab(a - b)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm x^\\frac{1}{3}-y^\\frac{1}{3} =z^\\frac{1}{3}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>By cubing both side we get,</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm (x^\\frac{1}{3})^3-(y^\\frac{1}{3})^3 - 3x^\\frac{1}{3}y^\\frac{1}{3}(z^\\frac{1}{3})=(z^\\frac{1}{3})^3\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm x-y - 3x^\\frac{1}{3}y^\\frac{1}{3}z^\\frac{1}{3}=z\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm x-y - z=3x^\\frac{1}{3}y^\\frac{1}{3}z^\\frac{1}{3}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm x-y - z=3xyz^\\frac{1}{3}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">By cubing both side we get,</span></p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm (x-y - z)^3=(3xyz^\\frac{1}{3})^3\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm (x-y - z)^3=27xyz\\)</span></p>\n\n<p>Now,</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">(x - y - z)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">3&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">- 27xyz = 27xyz - 27xyz</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr; 0</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&there4; Required answer is 0.</span></strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
