    {
      "id": "f8b7ec316575-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "Evaluate \\(\\frac{x^3-8}{x^2+2 x+4}=2\\) then x is:",
      "questionHtml": "Evaluate <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{x^3-8}{x^2+2 x+4}=2\\)</span> then x is:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "3",
          "html": "3"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{x^3-8}{x^2+2 x+4}=2\\)</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>(a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup>)&nbsp;= (a - b) (a<sup>2&nbsp;</sup>+ ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{x^3-8}{x^2+2 x+4}=2\\)</span></strong></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (x - 2) (x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 2x + 4)/&nbsp;(x<span style=\"font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ 2x + 4) = 2</p>\n\n<p>&rArr; x - 2 = 2</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; x = 4</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f8b7ec316575-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "If x + \\(\\rm\\frac{1}{x}\\) = 1, then the value of \\(\\rm\\frac{2}{x^2-x+2}=?\\)",
      "questionHtml": "If x +&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm\\frac{1}{x}\\)</span>&nbsp;= 1, then the value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm\\frac{2}{x^2-x+2}=?\\)</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "\\(\\frac{2}{3}\\)",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{2}{3}\\)</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1",
          "html": "1"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Given:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">x +&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm\\frac{1}{x}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 1</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Calculation:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">x +&nbsp;</span><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm\\frac{1}{x}\\)</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= 1</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ 1 = x</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- x + 1 = 0</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; x<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;- x + 2 = 1 (Adding 1 on both sides)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ....(1)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Now,&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm\\frac{2}{x^2-x+2}\\)</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm\\frac{2}{1}\\)</span>&nbsp;(From 1)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"\">&rArr; 2</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; \">&there4; The required value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\rm\\frac{2}{x^2-x+2}\\)</span>&nbsp;is 2.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
