      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f8b7ec316575-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "Simplify the following expression. (2a - b - 3c)(4a 2 + b 2 + 9c 2 + 2ab + 6ac - 3bc)",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Simplify the following expression.</p>\n\n<p>(2a - b - 3c)(4a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + 9c<sup>2</sup> + 2ab + 6ac - 3bc)</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "8a 3 + b 3 + 27c 3",
          "html": "8a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + 27c<sup>3</sup>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "8a 3 - b 3 - 27c 3 + 18abc",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">8a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup> - 27c<sup>3</sup> + 18abc</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "-8a 3 + b 3 + 27c 3",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">-8a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + 27c<sup>3</sup></span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "8a 3 - b 3 - 27c 3 - 18abc",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">8a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup> - 27c<sup>3</sup> - 18abc</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /> <u style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; display: inline !important;\">Shortcut Trick</u></span>\n<p>Apply the standard <strong>algebraic identity</strong>: (x + y + z)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> − xy − yz − zx) = x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> − 3xyz.</p>\n<p>Identify the terms: x = 2a, y = −b, and z = −3c.</p>\n<p>Substitute into the result: (2a)<sup>3</sup> + (−b)<sup>3</sup> + (−3c)<sup>3</sup> − 3(2a)(−b)(−3c).</p>\n<p>Simplified result: 8a<sup>3</sup> − b<sup>3</sup> − 27c<sup>3</sup> − 18abc.</p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is 8a<sup>3</sup> − b<sup>3</sup> − 27c<sup>3</sup> − 18abc.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Alternate Method</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Given:</strong> The expression is (2a − b − 3c)(4a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + 9c<sup>2</sup> + 2ab + 6ac − 3bc).</p>\n<p><strong>Formula Used:</strong> (x + y + z)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> − xy − yz − zx) = x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> − 3xyz.</p>\n<p>⇒ Let x = 2a, y = −b, and z = −3c.</p>\n<p>⇒ Check the second bracket terms:</p>\n<p>⇒ x<sup>2</sup> = (2a)<sup>2</sup> = 4a<sup>2</sup>, y<sup>2</sup> = (−b)<sup>2</sup> = b<sup>2</sup>, z<sup>2</sup> = (−3c)<sup>2</sup> = 9c<sup>2</sup>.</p>\n<p>⇒ −xy = −(2a)(−b) = 2ab, −yz = −(−b)(−3c) = −3bc, −zx = −(−3c)(2a) = 6ac.</p>\n<p>⇒ The given expression perfectly matches the <strong>identity expansion</strong>.</p>\n<p>⇒ Result = (2a)<sup>3</sup> + (−b)<sup>3</sup> + (−3c)<sup>3</sup> − 3(2a)(−b)(−3c)</p>\n<p>⇒ Result = 8a<sup>3</sup> − b<sup>3</sup> − 27c<sup>3</sup> − 18abc.</p>\n<p><strong>∴ The correct answer is 8a<sup>3</sup> − b<sup>3</sup> − 27c<sup>3</sup> − 18abc.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;\">Sum of Cubes Identity</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;\">The expression x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> − 3xyz is equal to (x + y + z)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> − xy − yz − zx).</p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;\">Special Case (Conditional Identity)</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;\">If the sum of variables x + y + z = 0, then the sum of their cubes x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> is exactly equal to 3xyz.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 2px 0;font-weight:700;color:#222222;\">Square of a Trinomial</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#444444;\">The square of three terms is given by (x + y + z)<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2xy + 2yz + 2zx.</p>",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/shortcut-trick-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/alternate-methord-image.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f8b7ec316575-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "If a - b = 1, a 2 + b 2 = 85 then a &times; b = ?",
      "questionHtml": "If a - b = 1, a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 85 then a&nbsp;&times; b = ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "40",
          "html": "40"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "84",
          "html": "84"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "42",
          "html": "42"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "80",
          "html": "80"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Formula Used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>(a - b)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;-&nbsp;2ab + b<sup>2</sup></p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Given that,</p>\n\n<p>a - b = 1&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ------(1)</p>\n\n<p>(a<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;+ b<sup>2</sup>) = 85&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;------(2)</p>\n\n<p>We know that</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">(a - b)</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;= a</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;+ b</span><span style=\" line-height: 0; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"\">-</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;2ab</span></p>\n\n<p>&rArr; (1)<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= (85) - 2ab</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&rArr;&nbsp;</span>2ab&nbsp;= 85 - 1 = 84&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"\">&there4;&nbsp; ​a &times; b&nbsp;= 84/2 = 42&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f8b7ec316575-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "On simplification, what is the value of the following expression: \\(\\frac{(a-b)^2}{(b-c)(c-a)} + \\frac{(b-c)^2}{(a-b)(c-a)} + \\frac{(c-a)^2}{(a-b)(b-c)}\\) ?",
      "questionHtml": "On simplification, what is the value of the following expression: <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(a-b)^2}{(b-c)(c-a)} + \\frac{(b-c)^2}{(a-b)(c-a)} + \\frac{(c-a)^2}{(a-b)(b-c)}\\)</span> ?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "0",
          "html": "0"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "(1)/(3)",
          "html": "(1)/(3)"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "3",
          "html": "3"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><strong>Given:</strong></p>\n\n<p>The expression to simplify is:</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\frac{(a-b)^2}{(b-c)(c-a)} + \\frac{(b-c)^2}{(a-b)(c-a)} + \\frac{(c-a)^2}{(a-b)(b-c)}\\)</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Substitution:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Let:&nbsp;a - b = x, b - c = y, c - a = z</p>\n\n<p>Now, rewrite the given expression in terms of x, y, and z:</p>\n\n<p>(x<sup>2</sup>)/(yz) + (y<sup>2</sup>)/(xz) + (z<sup>2</sup>)/(xy)</p>\n\n<p><strong>Formula used:</strong></p>\n\n<p>We can use the identity for the sum of cubes:</p>\n\n<p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = (x + y + z)((x + y + z)<sup>2</sup> - 3(xy + yz + zx)), which simplifies when x + y + z = 0.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Calculation:</strong></p>\n\n<p>Now, simplify the expression:</p>\n\n<p>(x<sup>2</sup>)/(yz) + (y<sup>2</sup>)/(xz) + (z<sup>2</sup>)/(xy) = (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup>)/(xyz)</p>\n\n<p>Since x + y + z = 0, we use the identity for the sum of cubes:</p>\n\n<p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = 3xyz</p>\n\n<p>Substitute this result back into the expression:</p>\n\n<p>(3xyz)/(xyz) = 3</p>\n\n<p><strong>&there4; The value of the given expression is 3.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
