      "questionHtml": "If&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(x^4+\\frac{1}{x^4}=322\\)</span>&nbsp;, x &ne; 0 then one of&nbsp;the value of&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\left(x-\\frac{1}{x}\\right)\\)</span> is&nbsp;",
